1
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:54,640
I've...

2
00:00:55,480 --> 00:00:57,240
turned into a man?

3
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:05,540
I wish to bring the General
some late-night snacks.

4
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:08,180
Please let me through.

5
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:17,200
Well...

6
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:19,200
Are you bribing me

7
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:21,220
or taking advantage of me?

8
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:44,700
Isn't this the one from last time?

9
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:47,360
He is the second male lead, Ning Yuanci.

10
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:49,600
General, have a cup of wine

11
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,800
to warm yourself up.

12
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:54,680
General,

13
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:55,520
spare my life!

14
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,210
Wait, what did she do to you?

15
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,080
Didn't I tell you that

16
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,840
no woman

17
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:08,039
is allowed near my courtyard?

18
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,760
You're a total player outside.

19
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,780
Stop pretending to be a saint.

20
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,200
Since the character bio

21
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:18,000
says I'm a loyal guard,

22
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,680
it never hurts to suck up to the boss,

23
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,600
right?

24
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:23,280
I was worried you'd get hungry
while bathing,

25
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,880
so I had her bring you a snack.

26
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:25,880
I promise

27
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,720
I won't give these

28
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:28,600
seductive women

29
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:30,200
another chance to tempt you.

30
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:32,000
Get my clothes.

31
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,320
This feel...

32
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,640
Sorry,

33
00:02:58,720 --> 00:02:59,720
I didn't mean to.

34
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,500
I'm even playing a man,

35
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,260
and he's still disgusted.

36
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,480
It's either bed scenes or nude scenes.

37
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:11,140
Do they have any other tricks?

38
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:18,880
That sword.

39
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:20,840
He's the one

40
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,079
who silenced me last time.

41
00:03:22,079 --> 00:03:23,400
What are you staring at?

42
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,480
Go get the clothes.

43
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:27,329
I'll go get the clothes for you.

44
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:34,140
Why are you acting so weird today?

45
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:35,620
What do you have to report?

46
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:37,240
N-N-Nothing.

47
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:39,200
He really is the ruthless second male lead

48
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:40,800
who kills without blinking.

49
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:43,480
What was his storyline again?

50
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:46,480
I only remember the beginning
of the synopsis,

51
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:47,320
which seemed to say

52
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:48,960
that the miserable Xue Ruowan

53
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,760
was forced to marry Ning Yuanci.

54
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:51,640
General,

55
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:54,480
are you going to marry Xue Ruowan,

56
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:56,320
the daughter of the Duke of Ying?

57
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:57,720
The wedding is tomorrow.

58
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,000
What do you think?

59
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:00,600
The wedding is tomorrow?

60
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:04,160
What if she refuses to marry you?

61
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:05,560
If she refuses,

62
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,600
there is only one way out for her: death.

63
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:11,160
She dies if she doesn't marry you?

64
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:13,000
What kind of gangster logic is that?

65
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,480
Could Xue Ruowan's poisoning

66
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:15,480
have something to do with him too?

67
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:16,160
Xue Shiyan

68
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:17,920
thinks the Emperor's bestowed marriage

69
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,279
is a test of his loyalty.

70
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:20,720
In fact,

71
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,280
I want the Xue family

72
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,840
to pay the price in blood.

73
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:27,200
Bro,

74
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:29,520
how am I supposed to respond to that?

75
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:31,890
I haven't even read Mo Xiang's script.

76
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:32,450
Let's go.

77
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,480
Come with me to the Duke's Residence.

78
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:36,340
We're bringing them a grand gift.

79
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,480
What grand gift?

80
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:46,440
This is the wedding dress
bestowed by His Majesty.

81
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,040
Only this

82
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:48,960
is worthy of my Wan'er.

83
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,720
A second male lead

84
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,159
who changes faces so easily

85
00:04:52,159 --> 00:04:53,159
and is clearly destined to turn evil.

86
00:04:53,159 --> 00:04:54,840
Wan'er lost her mother at a young age

87
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:56,480
and has always been frail and sickly.

88
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,880
I hope the General

89
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,200
will treat her well.

90
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:00,680
As long as she

91
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:01,920
marries me,

92
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:05,520
I will naturally treat her well.

93
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:07,800
Xiaolan,

94
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:11,320
Deliver the wedding dress
to the Eldest Lady's room.

95
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:11,920
Yes.

96
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:16,240
Last time, Lan delivered the wedding dress

97
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,800
and got killed by an assassin.

98
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,720
Xue Ruowan was also poisoned to death.

99
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,650
Is the plot going to repeat itself?

100
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,159
I have carefully selected

101
00:05:34,159 --> 00:05:35,220
this seasonal tea.

102
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,450
Please enjoy it, General Ning.

103
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:42,800
Wait.

104
00:05:43,960 --> 00:05:45,960
How can just drinking tea be enough?

105
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:47,640
Why don't you

106
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:50,280
just stay for dinner,

107
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:51,120
General?

108
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,760
I need to buy more time

109
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,060
to save Xue Ruowan.

110
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:02,720
Let me deliver it for you.

111
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:03,920
Go do something else.

112
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,400
How can a grown man

113
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,240
like you just walk into

114
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,520
the young lady's room?

115
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:08,800
Xue Ruowan's poisoning

116
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,560
and Xiaolan's murder

117
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,120
might all be tied to Ning Yuanci.

118
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,120
I've been reborn,

119
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,480
so of course I have to stop
the villain from causing trouble.

120
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,160
Girl,

121
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,720
I'm trying to save your life.

122
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,580
How can you not tell good from bad?

123
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,000
Who's your sister?

124
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:21,080
If you keep doing this, I'll scream.

125
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,200
Miss Xue.

126
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:32,159
Thank goodness.

127
00:06:32,159 --> 00:06:33,159
Sorry, sister.

128
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,290
Passing out here

129
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:36,040
is better than getting stabbed to death.

130
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,200
Sorry, I'm so sorry.

131
00:06:55,159 --> 00:06:55,920
Who are you?

132
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:58,780
None of your business.

133
00:06:58,920 --> 00:06:59,920
This medicine is poisoned.

134
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,780
Don't drink it if you want to live.

135
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:02,760
Lan,

136
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:04,650
I'm here to save you.

137
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:07,360
The one who wants to kill you
is Ning Yuanci.

138
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:08,720
Don't scream.

139
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,280
Brother Ning,

140
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,440
you said you wouldn't marry her,

141
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,000
right?

142
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:15,280
You called me here

143
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,640
just to say this?

144
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:22,840
Brother Ning,

145
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:25,520
you belong only to me.

146
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,000
You are mine.

147
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:46,040
A woman transmigrating into a man's body

148
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:48,100
and inheriting superb martial arts?

149
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,640
Ouch, ouch, ouch.

150
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:52,040
Again?

151
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,280
Go away!

152
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,240
Run!

153
00:07:58,440 --> 00:07:59,440
You again?

154
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:10,880
Help!

155
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,080
Assassin!

156
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:14,720
Help! Louder!

157
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:17,400
Help!

158
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:20,360
Assassin!

159
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:29,800
Just a petty thief.

160
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:30,840
Cui Hu,

161
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,039
take him down now.

162
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,559
So you're not the assassin?

163
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:38,400
No!

164
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:49,120
Watch out!

165
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:53,520
Cui Hu!

166
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:58,760
Am I...

167
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:02,920
Failed again.

168
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:24,200
So Ning Yuanci wasn't the assassin.

169
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:25,960
Then who exactly

170
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:27,360
wants to kill Xue Ruowan?

171
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:28,520
Actor Xia Yimo,

172
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:31,080
your plot mission has failed again.

173
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:31,880
Are you ready

174
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,220
to enter the next role?

175
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:34,600
Don't you have any

176
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:36,640
slightly higher-level roles?

177
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:38,440
Marginal roles like this

178
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:40,460
are destined to be cannon fodder.

179
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:41,930
What kind of role

180
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,280
do you want to play?

181
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:46,960
Can I choose?

182
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:49,280
Roles are randomized by the system.

183
00:09:49,280 --> 00:09:50,740
I can't give you spoilers.

184
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:52,290
Then why did you ask?

185
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,080
It's never a bad thing

186
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:56,200
to have expectations for your future.

187
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,520
After all, you only have three chances

188
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:58,440
left to play.

189
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,120
Then...

190
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:02,160
What happens

191
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,880
if I use up all five chances

192
00:10:03,880 --> 00:10:05,480
and the mission still fails?

193
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,340
You will be trapped here forever.

194
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,320
What?

195
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:12,320
I am willing to be a vegetarian for life,

196
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,640
praying to play

197
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:15,440
a noble,

198
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,360
highly skilled,

199
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:18,760
and beautiful woman
in the Mo Xiang script.

200
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,920
A choice that changes destiny.

201
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:21,960
In just a moment.

202
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,240
Good luck.

203
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,800
How dare you ruin our Second Miss's plans.

204
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:26,460
Beat her up!

205
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:27,760
Stop!

206
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:32,010
I'd like to see who dares to hit her.

207
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:42,800
Damn it!

208
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:45,250
I actually drew the role of a noble,

209
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,520
cunning,

210
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:48,890
and beautiful wicked stepmother.

211
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,960
Is this the character I get

212
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,680
for being a vegetarian my whole life?

213
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:57,720
Since she refuses to accept her fate,

214
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:59,400
let me teach her a good lesson.

215
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:07,120
This...
